+## Onlayn to'lov (webhook)
+
+To'lov xizmati mijoz to'lagandan keyin natijani serverga yuboradi. Natija panelda **«To'lov»** ustunida ko'rinadi (sahifa o'zi yangilanadi).
+
+```
+POST /payments/webhook
+Content-Type: application/json
+X-Signature: <HMAC-SHA256(PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET, tana) — hex, 64 belgi; «sha256=» old qo'shimchasi bo'lsa ham bo'ladi>
+
+{ "payment_id": "pay_123", "order_id": 15, "status": "paid", "amount": 120000 }
+```
+
+| Maydon | Nima | Qoida |
+|---|---|---|
+| `payment_id` | to'lov xizmatidagi raqam | matn (yoki butun son); bitta to'lov — bitta qator (`UNIQUE`) |
+| `order_id` | bizdagi buyurtma raqami (`#15`) | musbat butun son |
+| `status` | natija | `paid` (to'landi) yoki `rejected` (rad etildi) |
+| `amount` | summa, **so'mda** | musbat butun son; `orders.total` bilan solishtiriladi |
+
+- Imzo **tananing xom baytlaridan** tekshiriladi (`main.ts`: `NestFactory.create(AppModule, { rawBody: true })`), qayta JSON qilingan obyektdan emas. Imzo noto'g'ri yoki yo'q → `401`, bazaga tegilmaydi. `.env` da kalit bo'sh bo'lsa — hamma xabar `401`.
+- Javoblar: `200` qabul qilindi · `400` tana noto'g'ri · `401` imzo · `404` buyurtma yo'q · `409` `payment_id` boshqa buyurtmaga tegishli · `5xx` bizda xato (xizmat keyin qayta yuboradi).
+- **Takror xabar** (xizmat javob ololmasa qayta yuboradi) — `200`, `result: "duplicate"`, ikkinchi qator ochilmaydi; bir vaqtda kelsa ham (buyurtma qatori `FOR UPDATE`).
+- To'lov `paid` bo'lgach, shu `payment_id` ga keyin kelgan `rejected` uni o'zgartirmaydi (`result: "ignored"`, logda ogohlantirish).
+- Buyurtmaning to'lov holati (`orders.payment_status`) — hamma urinishlardan: **To'landi** (`PAID`, summa jamiga teng) · **Summa mos emas** (`AMOUNT_MISMATCH` — `paid` keldi, summa boshqa: admin qarashi kerak) · **Rad etildi** (`REJECTED`) · **Kutilmoqda** (`UNPAID`).
+- O'zgarish bo'lsa panelga `order-changed` · `reason: 'payment'` ketadi.
+- Telegram'siz tekshirish: `npm run smoke -- payment`. Qo'lda:
+  ```bash
+  B='{"payment_id":"pay_1","order_id":1,"status":"paid","amount":120000}'
+  S=$(printf %s "$B" | openssl dgst -sha256 -hmac "$PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET" -hex | awk '{print $NF}')
+  curl -X POST localhost:3000/payments/webhook -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H "X-Signature: $S" -d "$B"
+  ```
+
